      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 168
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il sogno della signorina Viola è quello di fare di\nLuminopoli la città con gli Allenatori e i Pokémon<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npiù forti di tutti!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grazie alla signorina Viola e ai MLL,\nLuminopoli avrà un futuro radioso.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061007A0069006500200061006C006C00610020007300690067006E006F00720069006E0061002000560069006F006C0061002000650020006100690020004D004C004C002C000A004C0075006D0069006E006F0070006F006C0069002000610076007200E000200075006E002000660075007400750072006F00200072006100640069006F0073006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con Persy alla reception\nil servizio è impeccabile.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006E00200050006500720073007900200061006C006C006100200072006500630065007000740069006F006E000A0069006C002000730065007200760069007A0069006F002000E800200069006D0070006500630063006100620069006C0065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grazie ai suoi consigli, abbiamo\nvisitato al meglio la città!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061007A00690065002000610069002000730075006F006900200063006F006E007300690067006C0069002C002000610062006200690061006D006F000A0076006900730069007400610074006F00200061006C0020006D00650067006C0069006F0020006C00610020006300690074007400E000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Va bene visitare la città, ma le lotte?\nIo voglio lottare!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061002000620065006E00650020007600690073006900740061007200650020006C00610020006300690074007400E0002C0020006D00610020006C00650020006C006F007400740065003F000A0049006F00200076006F0067006C0069006F0020006C006F0074007400610072006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nell’hotel c’è addirittura un salone\ndi bellezza per Pokémon.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0065006C006C20190068006F00740065006C00200063201900E800200061006400640069007200690074007400750072006100200075006E002000730061006C006F006E0065000A00640069002000620065006C006C0065007A007A0061002000700065007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’è pure una palestra per allenare\ni Pokémon. Fantastico!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900E80020007000750072006500200075006E0061002000700061006C00650073007400720061002000700065007200200061006C006C0065006E006100720065000A006900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E002000460061006E007400610073007400690063006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
